<item>
            <title>[LU-20607]  readv() into an mmap of the same file hangs</title>
                <link>https://jira.whamcloud.com/browse/LU-20607</link>
                <project id="10000" key="LU">Lustre</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Reproduction&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;1. mmap a Lustre file MAP_SHARED&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;2. lctl set_param ldlm.namespaces.&lt;b&gt;osc&lt;/b&gt;.lru_size=clear&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;3. readv() that same file into the mapping, iovecs overlapping the region being read&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;readv() never returns. The task sits in D state at cl_sync_io_wait, kill -9 does nothing, and the mount cannot be unmounted until reboot.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;&#160;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p&gt;Found by graph-hunter-v1&lt;/p&gt;</description>
